      "title": "Proof for rewrite-orphaned-specs — the three orphaned Configuration Helper specs now drive the operation Select",
      "summary": "Cites the rewritten it() blocks in the three named spec files that decide this task's four criteria, and records why the node this task implements, the suite-wide criterion and the underdetermined casing entry carry no test of their own from this task.",
      "task": "task/reconcile-orphaned-configuration-helper-tests/rewrite-orphaned-specs"
